def raw(p):
 b=p.read_bytes();return {'path':str(p),'bytes':len(b),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()}
paths=[p for p in sorted(base.rglob('*'))if p.is_file()and p.name!='retain.py']
paths += [bundle/n for n in ['source-commit.txt','source-sha256.json','sha256.txt']]
paths += [Path('work/task-supervisor/'+label+suffix)for label in ['prepared-realm','prepared-extras']for suffix in ['-state.json','.log','-config.json']]
paths += [Path('work/compat-cost-controls')/n for n in ['prepared-candidate-commit.log','prepared-merge.log']]
output={'source_commit':source,'scope':'Prepared host Script code for original realm-local Node policy, combined with incoming parsed eval and genuine scandir metadata','oracle':'Node v26.12.0 latest stable','checks':{'core':656,'api':371,'framework':43,'shared':7,'workspace_all_targets':True,'focused_realm_policy':1,'empty_differentials':5},'family':{k:family[k]for k in ['before','candidate','total','gained','lost','skip_changes']},'previous_full_loss_controls':[{k:v for k,v in r.items()if k!='command'}for r in controls],'fixed_work':{'valid':8,'clean':sum(bool(r['clean_rounds'])for r in fixed['fixtures'].values()),'speed_claim':False},'design':['Prepared Script code retains no guest objects. Each evaluation creates a fresh Script record, constants, caches and realm-bound functions.','The shared atom sequence is the runtime-state authority; reset and foreign-runtime handles are rejected. Core test covers both compiler modes, collection, private state and realm prototypes.','Configured SDK cache entries compare exact wrapper input, replace on source change and preserve original positions. Every realm still executes fresh unchanged primordial/error modules and owns actual hooks, brands and fallback state.','Node directory scans now report actualscandir syscall metadata; original Node oracle checks synchronous/callback error fields.'],'limitations':['All-parallel goal remains open. Latest completed sourcec4f full stable1789/5015 and pinned1817/4727 exclude this source. No selected-case totals substituted.','The18-case filesystem family has no losses or skip changes and no new full-case gain in this batch. scandir correction exposes a later existing async-options snapshot gap in fs-readdir-types.','All three prior timeout cases pass quiet30s controls on both old and new binaries; raw full losses remain. End-to-end GC-module time is not improved materially in this sample.','No speed claim: fixed-work8valid0clean. Direct initialization samples are diagnostic only.','Initial Core test link failed from disk exhaustion/SIGBUS before tests ran. Failed temporary and obsolete completed library caches were hashed/reclaimed; fresh successful656/656 retry qualifies source.'],'raw':[raw(p)for p in paths if p.exists()]}
